total-markdown (0.2.0~alpha2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Multi-platform release: added Windows (x64) and macOS (Apple Silicon) packages.
  * Accelerated markdown and image rendering via LocalImageCache and fast
    2-step downsampling (cold render down to ~16 ms, warm render ~7 ms).
  * Constrained table cell images to cell width for HTML and GFM tables.
  * Comprehensive UI, speed, and usability enhancements across editor and viewer.
  * Modernized header include guards across all translation units.

 -- Magomed Gadzhiumarov <magomedgadziumarov265@gmail.com>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:55:00 +0300

total-markdown (0.2.0~alpha1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial alpha release: two-pane live preview (CommonMark + GFM),
    syntax-highlighted code fences, LaTeX math, light/dark/system themes,
    remote images with a disk cache, animated GIF and SVG badge playback.

 -- Magomed Gadzhiumarov <magomedgadziumarov265@gmail.com>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 23:50:41 +0300
